From 2fc4079253ee6a9422c2915583dcd6f56aa43ce9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Landon <landon@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:28:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WebSocket serial bridge for web apps (--ws-port)

Serves serial stream 3 (the raw TCP G-code stream) over a WebSocket so
browser apps can drive the simulator like a Web Serial printer.

- RFC 6455 handshake and framing with no new dependencies
- 127.0.0.1 only; Origin check (localhost pages, plus --ws-allow-origin)
- one client at a time (409 for a second), clean stream per session
- host-only unit and live tests in test/websocket
