--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -86,10 +86,42 @@ Command-line options:
 | --- | --- |
 | `--agent-port <n>` | Enable the agent interface on `127.0.0.1:<n>` (or `MARLIN_SIM_AGENT_PORT`). |
 | `--serial-port <n>` | TCP port for the raw G-code socket (default 8099, or `MARLIN_SIM_SERIAL_PORT`). |
